WHAT OFL 1.1 ASKS. The copyright notice and the licence travel with every copy
(clause 2): each file keeps them in its own name table, and they are repeated
here and on the in-game credits screen. The fonts may be bundled with software
under any terms (clause 1) but stay under the OFL themselves and are not sold
on their own (clauses 1 and 5). The authors' names are not used to promote this
game (clause 4).
